network DefenseModel ⟦
    dense ⟬2⸴ 4⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬4⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary authorized ⟦
        rule owner_access ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧
    vault vault_v with authorized ⟬ DefenseModel ⟭ threshold ↦ 3 ·
    seal vault_v ·
    emit "STAGE_1_SEALED" ·
    unseal vault_v with authorized ·
    emit "STAGE_2_UNSEALED" ·
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬2⟭ input ↦ tensor⟬0.5⸴ 0.5⟭ ·
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬1⟭ pred ↦ DefenseModel⦅input⦆ ·
    emit "STAGE_3_INFERENCE_OK" ·
    wipe vault_v ·
    emit "STAGE_4_WIPED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧

